      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a concise talking point focusing on long-term vision: \"Senator, this Green Tech Subsidy Act isn't about short-term costs; it's about future-proofing our entire energy grid. By incentivizing high-capacity storage now, we are building the foundational infrastructure necessary to ensure reliable, sustainable energy for decades to come. This legislation guarantees the industry's leadership position and stability in the evolving global market.\"",
      "source": "target",
